# Operator UI (papercuspai.com — in-app papercusp surface)
#
# Chatwoot live-chat widget. Tags every conversation with `papercusp:operator`.
# Defaults are baked into ChatwootWidget.tsx pointing at the operator's
# current setup; override here for staging/dev or after the production
# Chatwoot DNS swap.
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CHATWOOT_BASE_URL — Chatwoot host
#                                    ⚠ Default uses a Cloudflare Tunnel URL
#                                      that ROTATES when the tunnel restarts.
#                                      Update the default in code OR set this
#                                      env var when chat.papercusp.com is wired.
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CHATWOOT_WEBSITE_TOKEN — papercuspai.com inbox token
#                                        (different from papercusp.com)

# NEXT_PUBLIC_CHATWOOT_BASE_URL=https://chat.papercusp.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CHATWOOT_WEBSITE_TOKEN=
